# DEPRECATED: an older profile without a [hal] table in ferrum.toml runs this
# file. Ferrum ignores it once ferrum.toml has [hal] (docs/hal.md).
# 7i76E field output drive modes, as Probe Basic's postgui file sets them
# (probe_basic_postgui.hal). LinuxCNC leaves the POSTGUI file to the GUI, so
# under ferrum these would otherwise stay at the card's defaults.
# Run through [FERRUM]POSTGUI_HALFILE in ferrum.ini, whatever modules are on.
# Keep the two values equal to probe_basic_postgui.hal's.
setp hm2_7i76e.0.7i76.0.0.output_source 0x0000F7FF
setp hm2_7i76e.0.7i76.0.0.output_sink   0x00000800
